XTQ 持续跟进 X Android 最新版本，而非局限于旧版或特定/固定版本；以 X 内私有本地浏览历史为核心特色：仅记录用户明确打开的帖子、视频或 GIF，支持重新打开与清空，不记录滚动曝光、自动播放或仅查看图片，也不上传数据；另提供链接净化、图片/视频/GIF 链接复制与下载、内容过滤、敏感媒体显示、高质量视频与投票结果选项增强。
XTQ keeps pace with the latest X Android releases instead of being tied to old or specific/fixed versions; its core/signature feature is private local browsing history inside X: it records only posts, videos, or GIFs the user explicitly opens, supports reopening and clearing, ignores scroll exposure, autoplay, and image-only viewing, and uploads no data; it also provides link cleanup, image/video/GIF link copying and downloads, content filtering, sensitive-media display, high-quality video, and poll-result option enhancements.
